<LegalPage title="Privacy Policy" description="How BIZ & STYLE DNA INC. collects, uses, stores and discloses personal data when you interact with its website and services." path="/privacy" updated="September 2026">
  <p>BIZ & STYLE DNA INC. ("B&S," "we," "us," or "our") is based in Florida and is committed to protecting the privacy and confidentiality of your personal information. This Privacy Policy outlines how we collect, use, store, and disclose your data when you interact with our website and services.</p>

